        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 4312, Nashville Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Two Piece Arched Nashville Handleset will fit in nicely with your home's country decor. This traditional handleset is perfect for adding a classic look to any front door. It is easy to install and will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick. The Nashville Handleset is available in dummy, single cylinder, and double cylinder functions. Choose from a wide array of beautiful finishes. The interior trim knobs and levers are also available in a bunch of different styles, so you'll be able to find the perfect look for your space.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Nashville Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Nashville Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Height: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Top Plate Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Top Plate Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Bottom Plate Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Bottom Plate Width: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Height: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 3\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 9-7/16\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4302-specifications.pdf?v=1704262354\"><b>Emtek 4312 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-C-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262297\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a key unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
